        "ggEllCIZG91_text": "<p>Baby wipes contain harsh ingredients that irritate sensitive eye tissue. Other eye wipes clean the surface—but they don't remove the bacteria underneath. That's why the stains keep coming back every morning.</p><p>That's why we created EyeWipes with a&nbsp;<strong>textured surface that actually lifts bacteria away</strong>—not just wipes the surface like baby wipes do. The&nbsp;<strong>antibacterial formula prevents regrowth</strong>, and the round shape makes it g<strong>entle enough that dogs don't fight it.</strong></p><p>No harsh chemicals. No struggle. Just a 30-second routine that actually works.</p>",
